CIAM platform for React applications
AuthN / AuthZ
Frictionless (user + developer) experience
- Improve user onboarding with passwordless authentication (passkeys, magic links, social login, etc.). 
- Provide native login experiences without redirects. 
- Integrate Descope authorization (RBAC, ReBAC, ABAC) into your app. 
- Eliminate complexity with no / low code workflows and SDKs. 
ATO Protection
Security minus friction
- Add adaptive MFA for risky logins and bots without impacting real users. 
- Leverage native risk signals like new / trusted devices, impossible traveler, and VPN checks. 
- Utilize risk signals from connectors with AbuseIPDB, reCAPTCHA, Forter, Fingerprint, and many others. 
- Securely authenticate APIs to prevent fraud and abuse. 
Single Sign-On
SSO sans struggle
- Support every flavor of SSO for your customers: SAML, OIDC, IdP- and SP-initiated. 
- Wow your tenant admins with self-service SSO and SCIM setup. 
- Add SSO across your AI stack with Shiny, Flet, Panel, Open WebUI, and more. 
- Seamlessly migrate existing SSO connections with zero downtime. 
User Management
Flexible user management
- Empower end users with self-service widgets (user profiles, user and role mgmt, access keys). 
- Collect the right information at the right time with progressive profiling. 
- Run A / B tests on different onboarding paths. 
- Let your customer support reps impersonate end user experiences for troubleshooting. 
